<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Telstra half-year net A$742 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Telstra half-year net A$742 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net (billion)			  0.742  vs 1.205</p>
<p>    Abnormal loss (billion)	    1.026  vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Telstra Corporation Ltd is a government-owned telecommunications group. It said it would recommend a dividend of A$625 million. The abnormal loss related to estimated redundancies and restructuring costs.</p>
</text>
